(6723035, 1005194, 12611, '<td valign="top">The scale of the shot is so big, that it has a difficult time conveying, or rather, allowing the viewer to absorb and create their own story. This is not really a criticism, because you get what you get, and because I liked the shot and gave an 8, also I could relate and saw a Miller''s crossing style story and mood in the shot. Perhaps subconsciously the voting bias was toward a more active and aggressive addiction, hence place 1 and 2.</td>', 'The scale of the shot is so big, that it has a difficult time conveying, or rather, allowing the viewer to absorb and create their own story. This is not really a criticism, because you get what you get, and because I liked the shot and gave an 8, also I could relate and saw a Miller''s crossing style story and mood in the shot. Perhaps subconsciously the voting bias was toward a more active and aggressive addiction, hence place 1 and 2.', '2012-03-26 09:39:07.000000', NULL, 0),
