(6723049, 1005103, 12611, '<td valign="top">Great clarity on the bread. When I see a stock type shot, I always look for a bit more, something that made the photographer choose the shot. Sometimes, its fun to get a really high quality baguette, and some super chocolate, not too dark, not too milk, and just warm the bread, not toast it, let the chocolate sit for a while and then. perfection. also works with sesame seed crusted bread. But then again, Nutella and fluff works too.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-03-26 08:58:11.</i></td>', 'Great clarity on the bread. When I see a stock type shot, I always look for a bit more, something that made the photographer choose the shot. Sometimes, its fun to get a really high quality baguette, and some super chocolate, not too dark, not too milk, and just warm the bread, not toast it, let the chocolate sit for a while and then. perfection. also works with sesame seed crusted bread. But then again, Nutella and fluff works too.', '2012-03-26 09:57:45.000000', '2012-03-26 09:58:11.000000', 0),
