(6723294, 1005141, 30982, '<td valign="top">Yes, had I voted I probably would have recognized these as Too kids, but mostly for their sense of adventure rather than individual characteristics.  That, and their dad''s style still comes through even with a Lensbaby.  Which is pretty cool.</td>', 'Yes, had I voted I probably would have recognized these as Too kids, but mostly for their sense of adventure rather than individual characteristics.  That, and their dad''s style still comes through even with a Lensbaby.  Which is pretty cool.', '2012-03-26 15:20:42.000000', NULL, 0),
