(6723834, 1005141, 54645, '<td valign="top">I figured this was you based on your past lens baby images. This image is full of what my kids call going on a Daddy adventure. Fantastic fun.</td>', 'I figured this was you based on your past lens baby images. This image is full of what my kids call going on a Daddy adventure. Fantastic fun.', '2012-03-27 04:33:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(6723845, 1004563, 131284, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for the great comments.<br/> <br/>Kevin: The use of f/2 with focusing a little way back in to the crowd was deliberate, in order to draw the eye in to the image and round, instead of getting stuck on what would be the most prominent figures in the foreground. I believe this works better when the image is larger than 800 pixels however, or if you take a step back from your monitor. Whether this is better than having the foreground in focus though I guess we can''t know, since I only shot it like this. Thanks for the constructive feedback.</td>', 'Thanks everyone for the great comments. Kevin: The use of f/2 with focusing a little way back in to the crowd was deliberate, in order to draw the eye in to the image and round, instead of getting stuck on what would be the most prominent figures in the foreground. I believe this works better when the image is larger than 800 pixels however, or if you take a step back from your monitor. Whether this is better than having the foreground in focus though I guess we can''t know, since I only shot it like this. Thanks for the constructive feedback.', '2012-03-27 05:23:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(6723849, 1005162, 131284, '<td valign="top">With only one vote lower than a 5 and the 4 votes that got wiped having an average score of 5.5 I don''t really think you can complain about low voters, or rather I look forward to the day I''m in that position =). Congrats on the blue!</td>', 'With only one vote lower than a 5 and the 4 votes that got wiped having an average score of 5.5 I don''t really think you can complain about low voters, or rather I look forward to the day I''m in that position =). Congrats on the blue!', '2012-03-27 05:55:13.000000', NULL, 0),
