(6752914, 1005033, 97225, '<td valign="top">I gave you 5 for this, but I think I hovered between 4 and 5 before clicking. I quite like the limited range of colour but the main aspect that failed to grab me was the composition. You could have had all that chocolate, but more compactly and artistically arranged. It is just too spread out and scattered. I agree with others that the vignette did not help.</td>', 'I gave you 5 for this, but I think I hovered between 4 and 5 before clicking. I quite like the limited range of colour but the main aspect that failed to grab me was the composition. You could have had all that chocolate, but more compactly and artistically arranged. It is just too spread out and scattered. I agree with others that the vignette did not help.', '2012-04-27 03:06:11.000000', NULL, 0),
