(6855774, 1004860, 150868, '<td valign="top">I see a little blooper: The dog''s front left paw isn''t resting on any surface but other than that it''s quite a clever shot. Good editing work. Using the same lighting for each of your poses would help the overall image as well but then again. I couldn''t have done it better. I like it!</td>', 'I see a little blooper: The dog''s front left paw isn''t resting on any surface but other than that it''s quite a clever shot. Good editing work. Using the same lighting for each of your poses would help the overall image as well but then again. I couldn''t have done it better. I like it!', '2012-09-03 23:18:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(6855779, 1004723, 150868, '<td valign="top">Thanks for sharing a bit of your own story in relation to this image.  You''re still alive and I hope living is your new drug of choice.  Great job on the emotion of the image with the shadows and limited lighting.</td>', 'Thanks for sharing a bit of your own story in relation to this image.  You''re still alive and I hope living is your new drug of choice.  Great job on the emotion of the image with the shadows and limited lighting.', '2012-09-03 23:26:34.000000', NULL, 0),
